noise: the sum is double: true
noise: the subtraction follows it to double: true
noise: so does the draw: true
chain: every node of the free chain is double: true
narrower consumer: the sum, the noise and the draw stay single: true
stated operand: the sum is double: true
stated operand: the subtraction over a single operand stays single: true
late specification: the sum is double: true
late specification: the subtraction over the half draw stays half: true
pinned node: the pinned subtraction stays single: true
no consumer: a free node settles at the session default: true
shared (noise, single consumer, double consumer): double single double
shared: the forcing order does not change the precisions: true
settled node: the consumer is double: true
settled node: the settled free node keeps single: true
gradient: the consumer's gradient is double: true
gradient: the free node's gradient follows it: true
gradient: so does the leaf's: true
double values: every value lies in [-0.5, 0.5): true
double values: some value of the noise is not f32-representable: true
double values: the noise pinned single is f32-representable: true
literal values: (1 + 2^-30) - 1 is exactly 2^-30 beneath a double consumer: true
half default: the noise and the draw follow the single consumer: true
half default: every value lies in [-0.5, 0.5]: true
half default: some value of the noise is not f16-representable: true
